<title>JAPAN: Mr Max - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mr Max - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.24		vs	   31.62</p>
<p> Operating	  804 million	 vs	    1.05</p>
<p> Current		1.37		vs	    1.36</p>
<p> Net		  650 million	 vs	  545 million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.43 yen	  vs	   15.19 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  36 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.50 yen	  vs	    6.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mr Max Corp is a retail store operator selling mainly consumer electronics and daily-use items.</p>
</text>
